{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The second DLC for MASH VP! Re:VISION! This DLC contains 10 tracks for Free Play Mode and 15 Mashup Tracks, totalling 25 tracks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring songs by AXTORM Sound Relation members, alongside collaborations with the VTuber ChumuNote and the group HiiT Factory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Also featuring additional Mashup tracks using 2 of our most popular songs, Xemetis and conflict!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Additionally, a Spring themed skin has also been added! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">These are the 10 songs for Free Play Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axtorchy / zz</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u5fd8\u5374\u4e71\u821e / AILE feat. \u5317\u689d\u97ff </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystic Moon / yuugen6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SMILE MANIA / HiiT FACTORY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Odyssey / siqlo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the end of confusion / \u30bb\u30ac\u30fc\u30eb\u5927\u4f50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vapor / DJ STORM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flash / Ace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make My Day / Hmt2 feat.ChumuNote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QUANTUM GATE / Tatsh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530340/extras/boukyaku_conflict_mashup.png?t=1744349775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, in Mashup Mode,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[\u5fd8\u5374\u4e71\u821e / AILE feat. \u5317\u689d\u97ff] x [conflict / siromaru vs Cranky]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Vapor / DJ STORM] x [Xemetis / Tatsh]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[UnClear / ron]  x [Odyssey / siqlo]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[the end of confusion / \u30bb\u30ac\u30fc\u30eb\u5927\u4f50] x [Athena / \u5343\u672c\u677e \u4ec1]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">alongside other Mashup Tracks are included, for a total of 15 Mashup Tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your setlist with these 25 tracks now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack also includes a new game skin, which is themed around cherry blossoms; a symbol of Spring in Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside the new game skin, Spring themed outfits for Shion and Ray are also included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530340/extras/Ray_springskin.png?t=1744349775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530340?t=1744349775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530340?t=1744349775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530340/1915ab931fb95d19e825f10e786bd2fd40c88d95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744349775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530340/1915ab931fb95d19e825f10e786bd2fd40c88d95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744349775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The second DLC for MASH VP! Re:VISION! This DLC contains 10 tracks for Free Play Mode and 15 Mashup Tracks, totalling 25 tracks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring songs by AXTORM Sound Relation members, alongside collaborations with the VTuber ChumuNote and the group HiiT Factory!</str